# Styling Guidelines - AI Image Editor

## Tailwind CSS v4 Configuration

### Custom Theme Setup (globals.css)
```css
@import "tailwindcss";

@theme {
  /* Custom Color Palette */
  --color-background: #000000;
  --color-surface: #111111;
  --color-card: #1a1a1a;
  --color-border: #333333;
  
  /* Gradient Colors */
  --color-gradient-yellow: #fbbf24;
  --color-gradient-orange: #f97316;
  --color-gradient-pink: #ec4899;
  --color-gradient-blue-light: #93c5fd;
  --color-gradient-blue: #3b82f6;
  --color-gradient-green: #10b981;
  --color-gradient-purple: #8b5cf6;
  
  /* Text Colors */
  --color-text-primary: #ffffff;
  --color-text-secondary: #9ca3af;
  --color-text-muted: #6b7280;
  
  /* Status Colors */
  --color-success: #10b981;
  --color-warning: #f59e0b;
  --color-error: #ef4444;
  
  /* Typography */
  --font-display: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-body: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
  
  /* Custom Spacing */
  --spacing-section: 2rem;
  --spacing-card: 1.5rem;
}

@layer base {
  body {
    @apply bg-background text-text-primary font-body antialiased;
  }
}
```

## Design System & Color Palette

### Core Colors
- **Background**: Pure black `bg-black` (#000000)
- **Surface**: Dark gray `bg-gray-950` (#111111) 
- **Card Backgrounds**: `bg-gray-900` (#1a1a1a) for main containers
- **Text**: White `text-white` with gray variants for hierarchy
- **Borders**: Subtle gray `border-gray-800` (#333333)

### Gradient Palette
```tsx
// Main title gradient (Yellow → Orange → Pink)
className="bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-400 via-orange-500 to-pink-500"

// Original image container (Pink gradient)
className="bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-300 to-pink-500"

// Preview container (Blue gradient)  
className="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-300 to-blue-500"

// Success/Generate button (Green → Blue)
className="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-blue-500"
```

### Status Colors
- **Success/Active**: `text-green-400` (#10b981)
- **Info/OpenAI**: `text-green-400` (#10b981)
- **Special/Face Mode**: `text-purple-400` (#8b5cf6)
- **Warning**: `text-yellow-400` (#f59e0b)

