## Responsive Design Principles

### Mobile-First Approach
```tsx
// Typography scaling
className="text-2xl md:text-4xl lg:text-6xl"

// Grid responsive
className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-6"

// Padding responsive
className="p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-8"

// Container max-width
className="max-w-sm md:max-w-2xl lg:max-w-6xl mx-auto"
```

### Touch-Friendly Design
- Minimum button height: `py-3` (48px minimum)
- Adequate spacing between interactive elements
- Large touch targets for mobile users

## Accessibility & Performance

### Focus States
```tsx
// Visible focus rings
className="focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500/20 focus:outline-none"

// High contrast focus indicators
className="focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white"
```

### Color Contrast
- Ensure minimum 4.5:1 contrast ratio for text
- Use white text on dark backgrounds
- Provide visual alternatives to color-only information

### Performance Optimizations
```tsx
// Hardware acceleration for animations
className="transform-gpu will-change-transform"

// Efficient transitions
className="transition-[background-color,border-color,color,fill,stroke,opacity,box-shadow,transform] duration-200"
```